{"page":483,"width":1668,"height":2538,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"544","words":[{"text":"544","x":167,"y":151,"width":57,"height":28}]},{"text":"Chapter 12 입출력 시스템","words":[{"text":"Chapter","x":294,"y":151,"width":116,"height":28},{"text":"12","x":422,"y":153,"width":36,"height":21},{"text":"입출력","x":486,"y":152,"width":62,"height":25},{"text":"시스템","x":557,"y":154,"width":62,"height":24}]},{"text":"요한 장치들의 인터럽트 핸들러들을 등록한다. 입출력 히는 동안에는 위에서 설명한 것","words":[{"text":"요한","x":294,"y":272,"width":64,"height":34},{"text":"장치들의","x":370,"y":272,"width":118,"height":37},{"text":"인터럽트","x":505,"y":274,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"핸들러들을","x":635,"y":275,"width":148,"height":35},{"text":"등록한다.","x":794,"y":274,"width":128,"height":36},{"text":"입출력","x":939,"y":274,"width":87,"height":35},{"text":"히는","x":1044,"y":275,"width":63,"height":34},{"text":"동안에는","x":1120,"y":274,"width":132,"height":36},{"text":"위에서","x":1267,"y":273,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"설명한","x":1383,"y":273,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"것","x":1494,"y":273,"width":26,"height":35}]},{"text":"처럼 출력을 마쳤거나, 새로 입력된 데이터를 가지고 있거나, 문제가 생긴 장치들이 인터","words":[{"text":"처럼","x":296,"y":329,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"출력을","x":367,"y":330,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"마쳤거나,","x":469,"y":330,"width":126,"height":37},{"text":"새로","x":608,"y":331,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"입력된","x":678,"y":332,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"데이터를","x":777,"y":332,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"가지고","x":909,"y":331,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"있거나,","x":1013,"y":332,"width":100,"height":35},{"text":"문제가","x":1126,"y":331,"width":99,"height":36},{"text":"생긴","x":1237,"y":332,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"장치들이","x":1316,"y":330,"width":128,"height":36},{"text":"인터","x":1462,"y":331,"width":56,"height":35}]},{"text":"럽트를 발생시기고 운영체제는 이를 처리한다. 운영체제는 인터럽트를 시용하여 여러 가","words":[{"text":"럽트를","x":296,"y":387,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"발생시기고","x":398,"y":387,"width":150,"height":36},{"text":"운영체제는","x":558,"y":389,"width":148,"height":35},{"text":"이를","x":718,"y":389,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"처리한다.","x":789,"y":390,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"운영체제는","x":926,"y":389,"width":157,"height":36},{"text":"인터럽트를","x":1096,"y":389,"width":162,"height":35},{"text":"시용하여","x":1270,"y":388,"width":130,"height":36},{"text":"여러","x":1417,"y":389,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"가","x":1493,"y":390,"width":30,"height":35}]},{"text":"지 예외(excephons)도 처리한다. 이러한 예외들의 예를 보면-어떤 수를 0 값으로 나","words":[{"text":"지","x":296,"y":445,"width":25,"height":36},{"text":"예외(excephons)도","x":339,"y":445,"width":276,"height":42},{"text":"처리한다.","x":630,"y":446,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"이러한","x":769,"y":448,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"예외들의","x":872,"y":447,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"예를","x":1008,"y":448,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"보면-어떤","x":1085,"y":447,"width":161,"height":35},{"text":"수를","x":1263,"y":448,"width":67,"height":34},{"text":"0","x":1345,"y":451,"width":18,"height":27},{"text":"값으로","x":1380,"y":447,"width":98,"height":34},{"text":"나","x":1493,"y":448,"width":30,"height":35}]},{"text":"누려 한다든가(divlde-by-zero), 액세스해서는 안 되는 메모리 영역을 액세스하려 한다","words":[{"text":"누려","x":293,"y":504,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"한다든가(divlde-by-zero),","x":366,"y":504,"width":375,"height":42},{"text":"액세스해서는","x":754,"y":505,"width":180,"height":36},{"text":"안","x":945,"y":505,"width":30,"height":35},{"text":"되는","x":988,"y":505,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"메모리","x":1061,"y":505,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"영역을","x":1172,"y":505,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"액세스하려","x":1283,"y":505,"width":161,"height":36},{"text":"한다","x":1460,"y":506,"width":62,"height":37}]},{"text":"든7K존재하지 않는 메모리 주소나 액세스하면 안 되는 메모리 영역), CPU가 사용자 모","words":[{"text":"든7K존재하지","x":293,"y":562,"width":193,"height":39},{"text":"않는","x":501,"y":562,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"메모리","x":570,"y":562,"width":85,"height":37},{"text":"주소나","x":669,"y":563,"width":90,"height":37},{"text":"액세스하면","x":770,"y":564,"width":148,"height":36},{"text":"안","x":931,"y":564,"width":31,"height":34},{"text":"되는","x":973,"y":563,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"메모리","x":1047,"y":564,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"영역),","x":1157,"y":563,"width":84,"height":38},{"text":"CPU가","x":1255,"y":564,"width":115,"height":36},{"text":"사용자","x":1382,"y":564,"width":98,"height":35},{"text":"모","x":1491,"y":570,"width":31,"height":25}]},{"text":"드 상태에서는 허용될 수 없는 특권 명령을 수행하려고 시도했을 때 등이다. 인터럽트를","words":[{"text":"드","x":293,"y":625,"width":32,"height":26},{"text":"상태에서는","x":336,"y":621,"width":154,"height":36},{"text":"허용될","x":502,"y":621,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"수","x":600,"y":622,"width":30,"height":35},{"text":"없는","x":643,"y":621,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"특권","x":711,"y":622,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"명령을","x":784,"y":623,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"수행하려고","x":883,"y":622,"width":154,"height":36},{"text":"시도했을","x":1051,"y":622,"width":128,"height":35},{"text":"때","x":1192,"y":623,"width":29,"height":34},{"text":"등이다.","x":1237,"y":623,"width":108,"height":35},{"text":"인터럽트를","x":1363,"y":623,"width":159,"height":36}]},{"text":"야기한 이벤트들은 모두 한 가지 공통적인 특징들을 가지고 있다. 즉, 그들은 운영체제가","words":[{"text":"야기한","x":294,"y":680,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"이벤트들은","x":398,"y":680,"width":151,"height":35},{"text":"모두","x":558,"y":682,"width":60,"height":33},{"text":"한","x":627,"y":680,"width":30,"height":34},{"text":"가지","x":668,"y":680,"width":55,"height":35},{"text":"공통적인","x":736,"y":680,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"특징들을","x":867,"y":681,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"가지고","x":1001,"y":681,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":1109,"y":681,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"즉,","x":1193,"y":683,"width":41,"height":34},{"text":"그들은","x":1248,"y":682,"width":101,"height":33},{"text":"운영체제가","x":1360,"y":682,"width":163,"height":36}]},{"text":"가능한 최단 시간 내에 독자적인 루틴을 수행해 줄 것을 필요로 한다는 점이다.","words":[{"text":"가능한","x":294,"y":738,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"최단","x":399,"y":738,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"시간","x":469,"y":738,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"내에","x":539,"y":738,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"독자적인","x":608,"y":738,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"루틴을","x":736,"y":738,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"수행해","x":835,"y":739,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"줄","x":938,"y":742,"width":31,"height":32},{"text":"것을","x":982,"y":740,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"필요로","x":1055,"y":740,"width":95,"height":34},{"text":"한다는","x":1162,"y":740,"width":100,"height":35},{"text":"점이다.","x":1275,"y":740,"width":106,"height":35}]},{"text":"대부륜의 경우 인터럽트 처리는 시간과 자원이 제한되어 구현하기가 복잡하기 때","words":[{"text":"대부륜의","x":353,"y":797,"width":118,"height":35},{"text":"경우","x":490,"y":797,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"인터럽트","x":564,"y":797,"width":117,"height":35},{"text":"처리는","x":697,"y":797,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"시간과","x":800,"y":797,"width":91,"height":37},{"text":"자원이","x":906,"y":798,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"제한되어","x":1015,"y":799,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"구현하기가","x":1159,"y":799,"width":169,"height":35},{"text":"복잡하기","x":1344,"y":799,"width":127,"height":35},{"text":"때","x":1492,"y":800,"width":26,"height":35}]},{"text":"문에 시스템은 인터럽트 관리를 1차 인터럽트 처리기(F니H)와 2차 인터럽트 처리기","words":[{"text":"문에","x":292,"y":856,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"시스템은","x":372,"y":855,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"인터럽트","x":509,"y":855,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"관리를","x":640,"y":856,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"1차","x":745,"y":855,"width":49,"height":36},{"text":"인터럽트","x":809,"y":856,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"처리기(F니H)와","x":948,"y":857,"width":243,"height":38},{"text":"2차","x":1206,"y":857,"width":54,"height":36},{"text":"인터럽트","x":1278,"y":858,"width":133,"height":35},{"text":"처리기","x":1429,"y":858,"width":89,"height":36}]},{"text":"(5니H)로 나눈다. F니H는 문맥 교환, 상태 저장 및 처리 작업을 큐에 삼입히는 작업을","words":[{"text":"(5니H)로","x":293,"y":917,"width":141,"height":35},{"text":"나눈다.","x":446,"y":913,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"F니H는","x":553,"y":916,"width":111,"height":33},{"text":"문맥","x":673,"y":914,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"교환,","x":745,"y":914,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"상태","x":825,"y":915,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"저장","x":900,"y":916,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"및","x":973,"y":916,"width":28,"height":35},{"text":"처리","x":1017,"y":916,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"작업을","x":1091,"y":916,"width":99,"height":35},{"text":"큐에","x":1202,"y":917,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"삼입히는","x":1282,"y":917,"width":134,"height":35},{"text":"작업을","x":1428,"y":917,"width":94,"height":35}]},{"text":"수행하고 별도로 스케줄 된 S니H는 요청된 작업 처리를 수행한다.","words":[{"text":"수행하고","x":291,"y":972,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"별도로","x":428,"y":972,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"스케줄","x":526,"y":973,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"된","x":625,"y":972,"width":28,"height":35},{"text":"S니H는","x":664,"y":975,"width":110,"height":32},{"text":"요청된","x":784,"y":974,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"작업","x":886,"y":975,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"처리를","x":961,"y":975,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"수행한다.","x":1064,"y":975,"width":138,"height":35}]},{"text":"운영체제에는 인터럽트를 다른 용도로도 시용한다. 예를 들면, 운영 체제는 가상 메모","words":[{"text":"운영체제에는","x":349,"y":1031,"width":182,"height":36},{"text":"인터럽트를","x":542,"y":1031,"width":146,"height":35},{"text":"다른","x":698,"y":1031,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"용도로도","x":768,"y":1032,"width":121,"height":34},{"text":"시용한다.","x":900,"y":1034,"width":130,"height":35},{"text":"예를","x":1046,"y":1034,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"들면,","x":1120,"y":1034,"width":73,"height":35},{"text":"운영","x":1206,"y":1034,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"체제는","x":1275,"y":1035,"width":98,"height":34},{"text":"가상","x":1386,"y":1034,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"메모","x":1461,"y":1035,"width":60,"height":34}]},{"text":"리 페이징을 위해 인터럽트 기법을 시용한다. 페이지 폴트는 인터럽트를 일으기는 예외","words":[{"text":"리","x":294,"y":1089,"width":25,"height":36},{"text":"페이징을","x":337,"y"